WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.250
Done looks like this.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.575
The export runs on a schedule as the
evidence reader and holds nothing more.

3
00:00:05.575 --> 00:00:10.038
Each period's package verifies and
continues the last period's chain.

4
00:00:10.038 --> 00:00:12.727
Every reported problem
has gone to its owner,

5
00:00:12.727 --> 00:00:15.199
and none sits in the package unexplained.

6
00:00:15.199 --> 00:00:18.600
Manifests are stored where the
exporter can't overwrite them.

7
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.412
Window adherence is reviewed with
the workbook's other measures.

8
00:00:22.412 --> 00:00:23.826
And the tests pass.

9
00:00:23.826 --> 00:00:27.225
Next, Chapter 8: one writer per attribute.

10
00:00:27.225 --> 00:00:28.390
Thanks for watching.
